  "verdict": "ACCEPT",
  "reason": "The patch adds a new keyword argument `negative_linestyles` to the `contour` function, allowing users to specify the linestyle for negative contours directly. This provides flexibility without overlapping with existing `linestyle` functionality. The implementation correctly uses `rcParams` as a fallback when the user does not provide a value for `negative_linestyles`. The docstring has been updated to reflect this new parameter."
